# Every text file is LF in the index AND in every working tree, whatever the
# checkout's core.autocrlf says (DnD-gspjs).
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materialised CRLF
# into files that bash, jq and the tests read directly: tests/profiles/*.env
# (a `CICD_STRICT_SKIPPED=false\r` value), engine/*.sh, engine/ci-status.jq and
# tests/engine/legacy/*.sh. Linux CI never saw it, so the suite was green there
# and nine specs were red on a Windows machine for reasons unrelated to the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

